[All Races Completed]
Author = community (DuckStation cheats.zip, v1.0/v1.2), re-derived for v1.1 by GT2Recomp
Description = The race-completion flag array (68 halfwords from 0x801C97C8 = save base + 0x118) filled with 0x1111, as the community code did on v1.0. GAME STATUS then reports the game complete (over 100%, as that code always did); the Arcade disc reads the same save to unlock its Simulation credits.
